open scoped NNReal
open NumberField GlobalTheory.IndefiniteRowSideFullHecke.QuotientEigenDifference GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Flat GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Flat.ExG

